        "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/broccoli/{size}/1861_2.png",
        "created_at": "2014-01-07T21:40:02.000Z",
        "cooked": "<p>I actually vacilate between Omnitron-\"ecks\" and \"ocks\". &nbsp;The reason for the latter is that I spent a ton of time writing up playtest games in the forums, so I started using O-X as a quick way to write the name, so I commonly refer to him as Ox (\"ocks\") when I reference him. &nbsp;Unlike Rabit, I have never received a disapproving glare to stop me, so I never thought anything of it. &nbsp; <img src=\"//forums.greaterthangames.com/images/emoji/apple/slightly_smiling_face.png?v=9\" title=\":slightly_smiling_face:\" class=\"emoji\" alt=\":slightly_smiling_face:\"></p>",
